<title>USA: CBT Q3 shr $0.31 with charge vs $0.37.</title>
<headline>CBT Q3 shr $0.31 with charge vs $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>PADUCAH, Ky. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>($ in thousands except</p>
<p>  per share data)	 Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					 Sept. 30,		Sept. 30,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Total assets		  942,690  892,706  942,690  892,706</p>
<p> Net income			2,454    2,907    8,584    8,601</p>
<p> Earnings per share	     0.31     0.37     1.09     1.08</p>
<p>Note: CBT Corp said third-quarter 1996 results included a pre-tax charge of $560,000, or $0.05 a share, related to the mandated recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
